WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.300
Narrator: Watch Majed.

2
00:00:01.170 --> 00:00:05.088
Narrator: The bag is hidden, it's taped up, it's not typical.

3
00:00:05.188 --> 00:00:11.116
Narrator: He picks it up, shakes it, and uses his radio right next to it - and he says 'bomb'.

4
00:00:11.216 --> 00:00:13.916
Majed: There's a bomb here!

5
00:00:11.216 --> 00:00:15.470
Narrator: Now the fans are frightened, and people could get hurt in the rush.
